(18, 'Mike Eric Johansen', 'mike@monkeydigital.co', 'Collaboration Request', 'Hi, \r\n \r\nThis is Mike from Monkey Digital, \r\nI am getting in touch regarding a exciting business deal. \r\n \r\nHow would you like to place our promotions on your website and connect via your custom referral link towards popular products from our business? \r\n \r\nThis way, you earn a 35% commission, continuously from any transactions that generate from your audience. \r\n \r\nThink about it, everyone need SEO, so this is a huge opportunity. \r\n \r\nWe already have over 12,000 affiliates and our commissions are paid out monthly. \r\nRecently, we reached $27280 in affiliate earnings to our affiliates. \r\n \r\nIf this sounds good, kindly chat with us here: \r\nhttps://monkeydigital.co/affiliates-whatsapp/ \r\n \r\nOr join us today: \r\nhttps://www.monkeydigital.co/join-our-affiliate-program/ \r\n \r\nBest Regards, \r\nMike Eric Johansen\r\n \r\nPhone/whatsapp: +1 (775) 314-7914', 'READ', '2025-05-11T08:51:59.000Z', '2025-05-11T08:51:59.000Z'),
(19, 'Mike Rodrigo Willems', 'info@hilkom-digital.com', 'Answer Engine Optimization (AEO)', 'Hi, \r\nIf you’re looking to grow your search traffic, monthly SEO is the way forward. \r\n \r\nAt Hilkom Digital, we deliver long-term growth through tailored SEO strategies, including advanced Answer Engine Optimization (AEO). AEO ensures your content is optimized specifically for AI-driven search platforms and featured snippets, significantly increasing your online visibility. \r\n \r\nOur monthly plans are engineered for results and ideal for teams that want impactful ROI — not just vanity metrics. \r\n \r\nDue to high demand and our commitment to quality, we can only accept a limited number of clients each month. This ensures every campaign gets the attention it deserves. \r\n \r\n______________ \r\nYour SEO Plan Covers: \r\n* Complete technical & content SEO \r\n* DA50+ backlink building \r\n* Smart keyword focus and tracking \r\n* Toxic link cleanup & disavow file handling \r\n* Paid indexing for faster rankings \r\n* Answer Engine Optimization (AEO) for featured snippets & AI visibility \r\n* International SEO options \r\n______________ \r\n \r\nSpots are limited — claim your monthly SEO plan now: https://www.hilkom-digital.com/seo-services/ \r\nWant to talk first? Chat with an SEO expert here: https://www.hilkom-digital.com/whatsapp-us/ \r\n \r\nLet’s boost your digital presence, drive traffic, and grow your business — the results-first way. \r\n \r\nBest regards, \r\nMike Rodrigo Willems\r\n \r\nHilkom Digital Phone/WhatsApp: \r\n+1 (855) 221-7591 \r\nsupport@hilkom-digital.com', 'READ', '2025-05-14T05:51:14.000Z', '2025-05-14T05:51:14.000Z'),
(20, 'Twesige Selegio', 'wilmafoxchildren@gmail.com', 'Re:Partnership  Inquiry', 'Greetings  from Uganda, \r\n \r\nMy name is Twesige Selegio, and I am the Director of Wilma Fox Child Development Centre Uganda, a non-profit organization dedicated to supporting orphans and other vulnerable children in Uganda. \r\n \r\nWe are writing to express our interest in exploring potential partnership opportunities with your organization. \r\n \r\nWilma Fox Child Development Centre Uganda provides education, healthcare, and emotional support to children in need. We believe a partnership could enhance our impact. \r\n \r\nWe\'re interested in exploring collaborations in: \r\n \r\n1. Nutrition Programs: Providing nutritious meals and promoting healthy habits. \r\n2. Education and Development: Supporting early childhood development, education, and vocational training. \r\n3. Community Outreach: Empowering communities to promote health, education, and well-being. \r\n \r\nA partnership would allow us to leverage our strengths and experience to make a lasting difference. \r\n \r\nWe\'d be honored to discuss this opportunity further. Please contact me to schedule a call or meeting. \r\n \r\nBest Regards, \r\nTwesige Selegio \r\nDirector, Wilma Fox Child Development Centre Uganda \r\nWhatsApp: +256785521916', 'READ', '2025-05-15T20:08:29.000Z', '2025-05-15T20:08:29.000Z'),
