(24, 'Mike Liam Moore', 'info@digital-x-press.com', 'Add AEO to your SEO strategies today !', 'Hi, \r\nI realize that some companies struggle grasping that organic ranking growth is a continuous effort and a well-planned ongoing investment. \r\n \r\nUnfortunately, very few marketers have the dedication to wait for the incremental yet impactful benefits that can completely change their online presence. \r\n \r\nWith Google’s evolving algorithms, a consistent, continuous SEO strategy including Answer Engine Optimization (AEO) is critical for getting a positive ROI. \r\n \r\nIf you see this as the ideal method, collaborate with us! \r\n \r\nCheck out Our Monthly SEO Services https://www.digital-x-press.com/unbeatable-seo/ \r\n \r\nChat With Us on Instant Messaging https://www.digital-x-press.com/whatsapp-us/ \r\n \r\nWe provide exceptional performance for your budget, and you will enjoy choosing us as your digital marketing ally. \r\n \r\nWarm regards, \r\nDigital X SEO Experts \r\nPhone/WhatsApp: +1 (844) 754-1148', 'READ', '2025-05-25T00:25:18.000Z', '2025-05-25T00:25:18.000Z'),
(25, 'Daniella Mein', 'daniella.mein@gmail.com', 'One Platform, Every Top AI Model—No Monthly Fees, No Hassle!', 'Access ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini Pro , Kling AI, LLaMA, Mistral, DALL.E, LLaMa & more—all from a single dashboard.\r\n\r\nNo subscriptions or no monthly fees—pay once and enjoy lifetime access.\r\n\r\nAutomatically switch between AI models based on task requirements.\r\n\r\nAnd much more ... hamsterkombat.expert/AIIntelliKit', 'READ', '2025-05-25T11:05:14.000Z', '2025-05-25T11:05:14.000Z'),
(26, 'Olivier Gabriel Balzac', 'projectoffice111@gmail.com', 'Web wining Notification', 'Congratulations! Your website address won you €985,000! We selected two million website addresses and ran our EU web program, which we do once a year as part of our summer web lottery promotion program. \r\nYour website address was selected as one of the winners, and your winnings have been deposited at La Caixa Bank in Spain. \r\nTo start the claim process, please send this code: Wining code 87-56-05, along with your website address, name, telephone number, and country, to this email address: olivier@balzcavocate.com \r\nAfter that, our agent will contact you to guide you through the payment process. \r\nSponsor by European Gaming. Eu \r\nunited-lotteries-for-integrity-in-sport.', 'READ', '2025-05-27T19:05:47.000Z', '2025-05-27T19:05:47.000Z'),
